[
  {
    "content_id": "10030001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;猶大王烏西雅、約阿施的兒子以色列王耶羅波安執政期間，大地震前兩年，提哥亞的牧人阿摩司看到了關於以色列的異象。以下是阿摩司的話。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他說： 「耶和華從錫安怒吼， 從耶路撒冷發聲。 牧人的草場枯乾， 迦密山頂枯黃。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「大馬士革人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回對他們的懲罰， 因為他們用打糧食的鐵器蹂躪基列。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在哈薛的王宮， 燒毀便·哈達的城堡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我要折斷大馬士革城的門閂， 剷除亞文平原的居民和伯·伊甸的掌權者， 使亞蘭人被擄到吉珥。 這是耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「迦薩人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回對他們的懲罰， 因為他們把被擄之人全都帶走， 賣到以東做奴隸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在迦薩的城牆上， 燒毀它的城堡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我要剷除亞實突的居民和亞實基倫的掌權者， 伸手攻擊以革倫， 剩下的非利士人都要滅亡。 這是主耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「泰爾人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回對他們的懲罰， 因為他們背棄弟兄之盟， 把被擄之人都賣到以東。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在泰爾的城牆上， 燒毀它的城堡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「以東人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回對他們的懲罰， 因為他們拔刀追趕自己的弟兄， 沒有半點憐憫之心； 他們怒氣不息，永懷憤怒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在提幔， 燒毀波斯拉的城堡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「亞捫人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回對他們的懲罰， 因為他們為了擴張領土， 竟剖開基列孕婦的肚腹。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要在戰爭的吶喊聲中， 在狂風暴雨襲來時， 降火在拉巴的城牆上， 燒毀它的城堡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他們的君王和首領要一同被擄。 這是耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「摩押人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回對他們的懲罰， 因為他們把以東王的骸骨焚燒成灰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在摩押， 燒毀加略的城堡。 摩押要在戰爭的喧囂、吶喊和號角聲中滅亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我要剷除摩押的首領， 殺死那裡所有的官長。 這是耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「猶大人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回對他們的懲罰， 因為他們厭棄耶和華的訓誨， 不遵守我的律例。 他們祖先祭拜的偶像使他們走入歧途。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在猶大， 燒毀耶路撒冷的城堡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「以色列人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回對他們的懲罰， 因為他們為了銀子賣掉義人， 為了一雙鞋賣掉窮人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他們踐踏窮人如同踐踏地上的塵土， 使卑微的人無處伸冤； 父子同淫一女，褻瀆我的聖名。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;在每座祭壇旁邊， 他們把窮人抵押的衣服鋪開，躺在上面， 又在上帝的殿裡喝剝削來的酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;「以色列人啊， 我在你們面前消滅了亞摩利人。 雖然他們像香柏樹那樣高大， 如橡樹那樣強壯， 但我滅盡了他們上面的果子， 砍斷了他們下面的根。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我曾帶你們出埃及， 在曠野引導你們四十年， 使你們得到亞摩利人的土地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我從你們的子孫中興起先知， 從你們的青年中興起拿細耳人。 以色列人啊，難道不是這樣嗎？ 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;可是，你們迫使拿細耳人喝酒， 禁止先知說預言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;看啊，我要壓碎你們， 如滿載穀物的車軋過一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;快捷的無法逃遁， 強壯的無力可使， 勇猛的救不了自己，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;拉弓的站立不住， 腿快的無法逃脫， 騎馬的不能自救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;到那日，最勇猛的戰士也要赤身逃命。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;「以色列人啊， 要聽耶和華責備你們的話， 責備我從埃及領出來的整個民族的話，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;『世上萬族之中，我只揀選了你們， 所以我要因你們的罪惡而懲罰你們。』」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;若非相約， 二人怎會同行呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;若非捕到獵物， 獅子怎會在林中咆哮呢？ 若非獵獲食物， 猛獅怎會在洞中吼叫呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;若非設下誘餌， 鳥兒怎會落入圈套？ 若非捕獲什麼， 圈套怎會收起來？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;若城中響起號角， 居民豈不恐懼顫抖？ 若災禍降臨城中， 豈不是耶和華的作為？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;的確，主耶和華不向祂的僕人——眾先知顯明祂的計劃， 就不會採取任何行動。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;獅子吼叫，誰不懼怕呢？ 主耶和華已發言，誰能不傳講呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要向亞實突和埃及的城堡宣告： 「你們要聚集到撒瑪利亞的山上， 看看城中的混亂和暴虐之事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他們不知正道，強取豪奪， 把擄物囤積在他們的城堡中。 這是耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;所以，主耶和華說： 「敵人要圍攻此地， 攻破你們的防守， 搶掠你們的城堡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「牧人從獅口中救羊， 只能奪回兩條腿和一塊耳朵。 同樣，住在撒瑪利亞的以色列人被救回的時候， 也僅剩一角床榻和一片臥椅。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;主——萬軍之上帝耶和華說： 「你們要聽這話，去警告雅各家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我追討以色列人的罪時， 要摧毀伯特利的祭壇， 將祭壇的角砍落在地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我要拆毀過冬和避暑的房屋， 破壞象牙裝飾的宮殿， 推倒許多宏偉的樓宇。 這是耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;住在撒瑪利亞山上的巴珊肥母牛啊， 要聽此言！ 你們壓榨貧寒人，欺凌窮苦人， 又叫丈夫拿酒來暢飲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;因此，主耶和華憑祂的聖潔起誓： 「時候快到了， 有人要用魚鉤鉤走你們，一個也不留。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你們都要從城牆缺口走出來， 被丟到哈門。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;「以色列人啊， 你們去伯特利犯罪吧， 去吉甲增添罪惡吧！ 要每天早晨獻上祭物， 每三天奉上你們的十分之一。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們獻上帶酵的餅作感恩祭， 並且到處誇耀你們自願獻的祭。 以色列人啊，這就是你們愛做的事。 這是主耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;「我在各城降下饑荒， 使你們遍地缺糧。 儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;「我在收割前三個月停止降雨。 我在一座城降雨， 在另一座城不降雨； 我使一塊田有雨水的滋潤， 另一塊田因無雨而乾裂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;兩三座城的人都踉踉蹌蹌地湧到一座城找水喝， 水卻不夠喝。 儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;「我用熱風和黴災擊打你們， 叫蝗蟲吞噬你們田園中的菜蔬、葡萄樹、無花果樹和橄欖樹。 儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;「我在你們中間降下瘟疫， 如從前降在埃及一樣。 我殺戮你們的青年， 擄掠你們的戰馬， 使你們軍營中的死屍臭味撲鼻。 儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;「我在你們中間施行毀滅， 如從前毀滅所多瑪和蛾摩拉一樣， 使你們像從火裡抽出的一根柴。 儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;「以色列人啊， 我要這樣懲罰你們。 以色列人啊， 準備迎見你們的上帝吧！ 因為我要這樣懲罰你們。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;看啊，那位造山又造風、 向人顯明其心意、 將黎明變為黑暗、 踏在地之高處的， 祂的名字是萬軍之上帝耶和華。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以色列家啊， 聽我為你們唱哀歌：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「少女以色列跌倒了， 再也站不起來； 她被遺棄在自己的土地上， 無人扶她起來。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因為主耶和華說： 「以色列家的城邑中， 出兵一千的，只有百人生還； 出兵一百的，只有十人生還。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶和華對以色列家說： 「你們要尋求我，才能存活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;不要去伯特利求問， 不要進入吉甲， 也不要前往別示巴， 因為吉甲人必被擄去， 伯特利也必化為烏有。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你們要尋求耶和華，才能存活。 否則，祂要在約瑟家如烈火爆發， 吞噬伯特利，無人能撲滅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你們這些使正義變為苦艾、將公義丟棄在地的人啊，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那位造昴星和參星、 使幽暗變為黎明、 使白晝變為黑夜、 召來海水澆在大地上的， 祂的名字是耶和華。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;祂使毀滅如閃電臨到強者， 摧毀他們的堅城。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你們憎恨在城門口主持公道的人， 厭惡說話正直的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你們踐踏窮人， 對他們橫徵暴斂。 因此，你們用鑿過的石頭建房， 卻不得居住在裡面； 你們栽種佳美的葡萄園， 卻喝不到葡萄酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我知道你們的過犯累累、罪惡無數。 你們迫害義人，收受賄賂， 在城門口冤枉窮人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;這是邪惡的時代， 所以明智者靜默不言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你們要棄惡從善，才能存活。 這樣，萬軍之上帝耶和華必與你們同在， 正如你們所說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你們要恨惡邪惡，喜愛良善， 在城門口伸張正義， 也許萬軍之上帝耶和華會恩待約瑟的餘民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因此，主——萬軍之上帝耶和華說： 「哀號之聲要響遍各廣場， 哭喊之聲將充滿大街小巷。 農夫被叫來哭泣， 哭喪者被召來哀號。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;每個葡萄園都傳出哀號聲， 因為我要從你們中間經過。 這是耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;盼望耶和華的日子到來的人有禍了！ 你們為什麼盼望耶和華的日子呢？ 那日將帶來黑暗，而非光明。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你們的光景將好像人逃避獅子， 卻遇上了熊， 逃回家裡，手扶牆壁， 又被蛇咬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;耶和華的日子將充滿黑暗，毫無光明， 一片漆黑， 毫無亮光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;「我憎惡、鄙棄你們的節期， 厭惡你們的聖會。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;即使你們獻上燔祭和素祭， 我也不悅納； 即使你們用肥美的牲畜獻上平安祭， 我也不屑一顧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;消除你們嘈雜的歌聲吧， 我不想聽到你們的琴音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;唯願公正如江河滔滔不盡， 公義如溪流綿綿不絕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;以色列家啊， 在曠野的四十年間， 你們向我獻過祭物和供物嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;你們抬著為自己造的神像， 就是你們的王撒固和星神迦溫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 5:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;所以我要把你們流放到比大馬士革還遠的地方。」 這是耶和華說的，祂的名字是萬軍之上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;在錫安生活安逸舒適的人啊， 你們有禍了！ 在撒瑪利亞山上自覺無憂的人啊， 你們有禍了！ 你們是列國之首以色列的顯要， 以色列人都仰望你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你們去甲尼看看， 然後從那裡到哈瑪大城， 再到非利士人的迦特看看。 你們比這些國家更好嗎？ 他們的領土不比你們的更廣闊嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你們以為災難的日子離得還遠， 就大肆施行暴政。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你們躺在象牙床上，閒靠在臥榻上， 你們吃養在圈裡的肥嫩牛羊。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們伴著琴聲唱慵懶的歌， 像大衛一樣為自己製造樂器。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你們以大碗狂飲， 用上等膏油抹身， 卻漠不關心約瑟家的衰亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;所以，你們要首先被擄， 你們的宴樂將從此消逝！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;萬軍之上帝——主耶和華憑自己起誓說： 「我憎惡雅各的驕傲， 厭棄他的城堡。 我要把城和城中的一切都交給敵人。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;那時，如果一棟房子裡剩下十人，這十人也要死亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;親屬抬出屍體焚燒時，必問內屋的人：「你那裡還有別人嗎？」那人必回答：「沒有。」問的人必說：「不要作聲，我們不可提耶和華的名。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;看啊，耶和華一聲令下， 大屋頓成瓦礫，小房化為碎片。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;馬能在懸崖上奔馳嗎？ 牛能在海中耕作嗎？ 你們卻使公正淪為毒藥， 使公義之果變成苦艾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你們炫耀自己征服了羅底巴， 吹噓憑自己的能力奪取了加寧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 6:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;萬軍之上帝耶和華說： 「以色列家啊， 我要使一個國家興起攻擊你們， 從哈馬口直至亞拉巴河， 他們要到處欺壓你們。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是主耶和華讓我看見的異象：看啊，祂造了一大群蝗蟲。那時，王室的作物已經收割，第二季作物剛開始發苗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;蝗蟲吃盡地上的青苗時，我說：「主耶和華啊，求你赦免！雅各那麼弱小，他怎麼受得了呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;於是，耶和華心生憐憫，說：「我不降這災了。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;以下是主耶和華讓我看見的異象：看啊，主耶和華降下審判的大火。大火燒乾了深淵，正在吞噬土地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;那時，我說：「主耶和華啊，求你停止吧！雅各那麼弱小，他怎麼受得了呢？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;於是，耶和華心生憐憫，說：「我也不降這災了。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;以下是祂讓我看見的異象：看啊，主站在一道按照準繩建造的牆邊，手裡拿著準繩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和華對我說：「阿摩司，你看見什麼？」我答道：「一條準繩。」主說：「我要在我的以色列子民中吊起準繩，我不會再饒恕他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;以撒子孫的邱壇必遭毀壞，以色列的廟宇必成廢墟，我要用刀攻擊耶羅波安王朝。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;伯特利的祭司亞瑪謝派人告訴以色列王耶羅波安：「阿摩司在以色列家圖謀背叛你，我們國家無法容忍他的言論。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因為阿摩司這樣說，『耶羅波安將喪身刀下，以色列人必被擄去，遠離家鄉。』」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;亞瑪謝對阿摩司說：「先見啊，走吧！逃回猶大去吧！你要在那裡掙吃的，在那裡說預言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;不可再在伯特利說預言，這裡是王的聖所，是國廟。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;阿摩司答道：「我本不是先知，也不是先知的門徒。我只是一個牧人，也看護桑樹。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;但耶和華不再讓我看守羊群，祂對我說，『去！向我的以色列子民說預言。』</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;現在你要聽耶和華對你說的話。你說，『不要說攻擊以色列的預言，不要傳講攻擊以撒子孫的信息。』</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 7:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;所以耶和華說，『你的妻子必在這城裡淪為妓女，你的兒女必喪身刀下，你的田地必被人丈量、瓜分，你自己必死在異鄉。以色列人必被擄去，遠離家鄉。』」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;這是主耶和華讓我看見的異象：看啊，一籃夏天的果子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;耶和華問我：「阿摩司，你看見什麼？」我說：「我看見一籃夏天的果子。」祂說：「我以色列子民的結局到了，我不會再饒恕他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;到那日，宮殿裡的歌聲要變成哀號；屍橫遍地，一片死寂。這是主耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;踐踏貧民、滅絕窮人的人啊， 你們要聽！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們盼望朔日和安息日快點過去， 你們好售賣穀物。 你們用小升斗賣糧， 用加重的砝碼收銀子， 用詭詐的秤欺騙人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你們用銀子買貧民， 以一雙鞋買窮人為奴， 售賣摻了糠秕的麥子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶和華憑雅各的驕傲起誓： 「我決不會忘記你們的所作所為。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;這片土地要因此而震動， 所有的居民都要悲哀。 大地要像尼羅河一樣漲起，如埃及的河流翻騰退落。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;主耶和華說： 「到那日，我要使太陽中午落下， 使大地在白天一片黑暗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我要使你們的節期變為喪禮， 叫你們的歡歌變為哀歌。 我要使你們都腰束麻布，剃光頭髮； 我要使你們傷心欲絕，如喪獨生子； 我要使那日成為痛苦的日子。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;主耶和華說： 「日子將到，我要使饑荒降在地上。 人饑餓非因無餅，乾渴非因無水， 而是因為聽不到耶和華的話。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;人們從南到北，從東到西， 在境內四處奔走， 要尋找耶和華的話卻找不到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;「到那日， 「美麗少女和青春少男都要因乾渴而昏倒；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 8:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;那些憑撒瑪利亞、但和別示巴的神明起誓的， 都要跌倒，永不再起來。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我看見主站在祭壇旁，祂說： 「你要擊打柱頂，使殿的根基震動； 要打碎它們，使殿宇坍塌壓死眾人。 僥倖生還的，我要用刀劍殺掉， 無人能逃脫，無人能倖免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;即使他們挖洞鑽進陰間， 我也要把他們揪出來； 即使他們爬上高天， 我也要把他們拉下來；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;即使他們藏在迦密山的峰頂， 我也要去搜尋，捉住他們； 即使他們潛到海底， 我也要派海蛇去吞咬他們；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;即使他們被敵人擄去， 我也要命刀劍追殺他們。 我要定睛在他們身上， 不是要賜福而是要降禍。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;主——萬軍之耶和華觸摸大地， 大地就消融，地上的人都要哀號； 大地如埃及的尼羅河漲起退落。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那位在天上建造樓閣， 在大地之上立定穹蒼， 召來海水澆在大地上的—— 祂的名字是耶和華。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「以色列人啊， 在我眼中，你們不是和古實人一樣嗎？ 我不是領你們出埃及， 領非利士人出迦斐托， 領亞蘭人出吉珥嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;主耶和華的眼目察看這罪惡的國家， 我要從地上除滅它， 但不會完全毀滅雅各家。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;「因為我要下令在萬國中篩以色列家， 就像人篩穀物，一粒石子也不會落在地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;在我的子民中， 所有誇口說『災禍不會追上我們，也不會迎面而來』的罪人， 都要死在刀下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;「到那日， 我要重建大衛已傾覆的棚子， 修補它城牆的缺口。 我要從廢墟中重建它， 恢復它往日的榮耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;這樣，以色列人必擁有以東所剩的和所有屬於我名下的國家。 這是要成就這事的耶和華說的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「時候將到， 五穀還未收完又該耕種了， 葡萄還未踩完又該栽種了。 甜酒從群山上滴下，在丘嶺間流淌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我要使我被擄的以色列子民返鄉， 他們要重建廢城並住在城中， 栽種葡萄園，喝園中釀出的美酒， 整理園圃，吃園中出產的佳果。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司書 9:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我要將以色列人栽種在他們自己的土地上， 他們永不再從我賜給他們的土地上被剷除。」 這是你們的上帝耶和華說的。</p>"
  }
]